\">Serpent Kingdoms</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 12. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\">0-7869-3277-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-tFRA-p9-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-tFRA-p9_3-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karen_Wynn_Fonstad\" title=\"Karen Wynn Fonstad\">Karen Wynn Fonstad</a> (August 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Forgotten_Realms_Atlas\" title=\"The Forgotten Realms Atlas\">The Forgotten Realms Atlas</a></i>. (<a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc\" title=\"TSR, Inc\">TSR, Inc</a>), p. 9. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0880388573\">978-0880388573</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS3e-p177-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS3e-p177_4-0\">4.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS3e-p177_4-1\">4.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS3e-p177_4-2\">4.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Reid\" title=\"Thomas Reid\">Thomas Reid</a> (October 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shining_South_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Shining South (sourcebook)\">Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 177. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\">0-7869-3492-1</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SK-p98-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p98_5-0\">5.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p98_5-1\">5.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p98_5-2\">5.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" title=\"Eric L. Boyd\">Eric L. Boyd</a>, <a href